<title>UK: Yamaichi details Finland 150 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Yamaichi details Finland 150 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The issue price on the following bond, launched earlier on Tuesday, has now been disclosed, sole lead manager Yamaichi International (Europe) said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINLAND</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     6.78	MATURITY    27.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.10     PAY DATE  S-29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    =	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FINLAND   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
